# Stand-alone analytic frequency calculation (e.g. after a TS optimisation
# that was run without Freq, or to re-check a structure). The cap atoms are
# frozen during optimisation but NOT during the Hessian: expect a few small
# imaginary or near-zero modes that involve the frozen atoms (see README).
# QuasiRRHO true applies Grimme's quasi-RRHO entropy treatment (ORCA 6).
! B3LYP D3BJ def2-SVP def2/J RIJCOSX CPCM(water) TightSCF AnFreq

%pal nprocs 16 end
%maxcore 3000

%cpcm
  epsilon 4.0
end

%freq
  QuasiRRHO true
  Temp 298.15
end

* xyzfile 1 1 orca_ts.xyz
